{#- One module parameter of the behaviour module (docs/SCE_TEST_PROFILE.md
    §9.5, §11.8): `modulepar T name := value;` (ES 201 873-1 §8.2.1) for one
    the suite declares, the bound in bytes of a text or a byte string stated
    beside it as the types module states a field's; `modulepar boolean name;`
    with no default for the one of a feature (E15), whose value the caller
    gives. `parameter` is `ttcn3_export::behaviour::ModuleParameterView`. -#}
{%- import "ttcn3/_types.ttcn.jinja2" as types -%}
{% set b = types.bound(parameter.type) %}
modulepar {{ types.type_expr(parameter.type) }} {{ parameter.name }}{% if parameter.value is not none %} := {{ parameter.value }}{% endif %};{% if b %} // {{ b }}{% endif %}
